1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:07,737
Every year, crop diseases destroy up to forty percent of agricultural yields before farmers can consult a specialist.

2
00:00:07,687 --> 00:00:11,175
AgriVision AI bridges this critical gap.

3
00:00:11,175 --> 00:00:18,975
It is an enterprise-grade precision agriculture platform powered by real-time edge deep learning and an explainable agronomy engine.

4
00:00:18,975 --> 00:00:25,012
Entering the platform as a verified model farmer, the central command center instantly loads.

5
00:00:25,012 --> 00:00:34,987
Farm managers and agronomists can track active field health index scores, monitor recent diagnostic scans, and review crop risk indicators in real time.

6
00:00:34,987 --> 00:00:38,662
Let's see the core diagnosis workflow in action.

7
00:00:38,662 --> 00:00:44,387
We upload a symptomatic field leaf specimen and trigger an AI diagnostic scan.

8
00:00:44,387 --> 00:00:54,275
Instead of relying on a slow remote cloud server, our custom MobileNetV3 deep learning model executes locally on the CPU in under fifty milliseconds.

9
00:00:54,275 --> 00:01:03,312
It accurately detects Tomato Late Blight with eighty-eight percent confidence, providing a full breakdown of the top three probabilistic classifications.

10
00:01:03,312 --> 00:01:09,300
Unlike traditional black-box AI, AgriVision provides explainable diagnostics.

11
00:01:09,300 --> 00:01:17,612
By toggling the neural attention heatmap, farmers can visually verify the exact necrotic lesion regions that guided the model's prediction.

12
00:01:17,612 --> 00:01:23,212
The platform immediately pairs this with actionable chemical and organic treatment regimens.

13
00:01:23,212 --> 00:01:30,362
When growers have specific questions in the field, AgriVision provides a bilingual semantic RAG assistant.

14
00:01:30,362 --> 00:01:42,912
Backed by a high-speed BM25 knowledge engine indexing official agronomy handbooks, it retrieves certified spraying schedules, fungicide dosages, and preventive guidance in just three milliseconds.

15
00:01:42,912 --> 00:01:54,037
Every diagnostic scan automatically syncs into official field reports, ready to download as a verified certification report for agricultural extension services and crop insurance.

16
00:01:54,037 --> 00:02:00,462
AgriVision AI puts instant, reliable agronomy expertise right into farmers' hands.